      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_139",
      "message_id": 139,
      "file_path": "/COMMON/MESFILE.DK4",
      "commodity": "Corn",
      "speaker": "Price Info",
      "context": "The player opens the selected commodity’s description in Market Price Info.",
      "english": "Corn ranks with wheat and rice among the world's three major grains. It was grown in the New World before the Common Era. Corn is also used to make bourbon.",
      "previous_English": "Corn ranks with wheat and rice\namong the world's three major \ngrains. It was grown in the New \nWorld before the Common Era.\nCorn is also used to make bourbon.",
      "Japanese": "小麦、米（稲）と並ぶ世界の３大穀物の\n１つ。新大陸では紀元前から栽培されて\nいた。バーボンウィスキーの原料でもあ\nる。",
      "source_meaning": "One of the world’s three major grains with wheat and rice, cultivated in the New World before the Common Era and also used for bourbon.",
