    {
      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_147",
      "message_id": 147,
      "file_path": "/COMMON/MESFILE.DK4",
      "commodity": "Bananas",
      "speaker": "Price Info",
      "context": "The player opens the selected commodity’s description in Market Price Info.",
      "english": "A large Asian perennial in the banana family. Its fruit is a tropical staple. Bananas eaten raw are sweeter than cooking varieties.",
      "previous_English": "The fruit of a large\nperennial plant native\nto Asia and a staple\nin the tropics. \nVarieties eaten raw are sweeter and \ndiffer from those used for cooking.",
      "Japanese": "バショウ科の大形の多年草。果実を食べ\nる。アジア原産。熱帯では主食となる。\n生で食べるものは糖分が多く、料理用品\n種とは異なる。",
      "source_meaning": "The edible fruit of a large perennial in the banana family, native to Asia and a staple in the tropics. Raw varieties contain more sugar than cooking varieties.",
