    {
      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_157",
      "message_id": 157,
      "file_path": "/COMMON/MESFILE.DK4",
      "commodity": "Shark Fin",
      "speaker": "Price Info",
      "context": "The player opens the selected commodity’s description in Market Price Info.",
      "english": "Dried fins from large sharks. Tail fins are prized over dorsal and pectoral fins. Soak until soft, then simmer or add to soup.",
      "previous_English": "Dried fins from large sharks. \nOf the tail, dorsal, and\npectoral fins, the tail \nfin is the most prized. \nThe fins are soaked until soft, then\nsimmered or used in soup.",
      "Japanese": "大型のサメのヒレを乾燥させたもの。尾\n背・胸のうち、尾ヒレのものが上級。柔\nらかくもどして、煮込んだり、スープに\n使う。",
      "source_meaning": "Fins from large sharks are dried. Tail fins are preferred to dorsal and pectoral fins. The fins are soaked until soft and simmered or used in soup.",
