    {
      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_159",
      "message_id": 159,
      "file_path": "/COMMON/MESFILE.DK4",
      "commodity": "Cloves",
      "speaker": "Price Info",
      "context": "The player opens the selected commodity’s description in Market Price Info.",
      "english": "Dried clove buds from the myrtle family. A fragrant spice for meat, ranked in the top three with pepper and cinnamon.",
      "previous_English": "Cloves are the dried\nflower buds of the\nclove tree, a member\nof the myrtle family. \nA fragrant spice for meat, ranked \nwith pepper and cinnamon.",
      "Japanese": "フトモモ科チョウジのつぼみを乾燥させ\nたもの。コショウ・シナモンと並ぶ３大\n香辛料の１つ。別名クローブ。香りがよ\nく肉料理などに用いる。",
      "source_meaning": "The dried buds of the myrtle-family clove tree, counted among the three major spices with pepper and cinnamon. Fragrant and used in meat dishes.",
